sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant W as Worker (Node.js)
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant T as Monitored service
  W->>DB: Claim due targets (FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED)
  DB-->>W: payments-api, search, ...
  W->>T: GET /healthz (timeout 3s)
  T-->>W: 503 Service Unavailable
  W->>DB: BEGIN: save check, failures = 3
  Note over W,DB: 3 failures in a row: open ONE alert
  W->>DB: INSERT alert ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING, then COMMIT
  W->>T: later: GET /healthz
  T-->>W: 200 OK (2nd success in a row)
  W->>DB: resolve the alert automatically
